.Sh HISTORY
The
.Vt "struct fileops"
table has existed since
.Bx 4.4 .
.Fn fo_pathconf ,
.Fn fo_statfs ,
.Fn fo_fsync ,
.Fn fo_setattr ,
.Fn fo_fadvise ,
.Fn fo_readdir ,
.Fn fo_copy_file_range ,
.Fn fo_acl ,
.Fn fo_extattr ,
.Fn fo_fcntl
and
.Fn fo_advlock
first appeared in 5BSD, in the series that made every descriptor type
answer its own system calls without the kernel reaching past the table to
a vnode.
